{"cover":0,"images":[{"base64":"","media_type":"image/png","name":"1-board.png","sha256":"d8b4697bac8feed918421bbb50e21ed2bbafa8d724ef54dbc7e1e4c623b7902b"},{"base64":"","media_type":"image/png","name":"2-detail.png","sha256":"339770518c663ef368727dfc9975777e6582c068cd1fe40049a7e6788c18f68f"},{"base64":"","media_type":"image/png","name":"3-filtered.png","sha256":"9d6ad5881bbf895249b7841db464c2ee833c234ae0a646ac81e3c2e0c4bd9025"}],"schema":"makefun/dossier/v1","text":"## Dashboard\n\nFiles: 3 (2350 bytes)\n- app.css (725 bytes)\n- app.js (780 bytes)\n- index.html (845 bytes)\n\n## Source\n\n### app.css\n\n725 bytes, 14 lines\n\n```css\n:root{--bg:#0e1116;--fg:#e6e9ef;--muted:#8a93a6;--accent:#4cc2ff;--panel:#161b24}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:15px/1.45 system-ui,sans-serif}\nheader{padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid #232b3a}\nh1{margin:0;font-size:22px}\n.ph{color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0}\nmain{display:grid;gap:24px;padding:24px 28px}\nsection{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #232b3a;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px}\nh2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}\nth,td{padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #232b3a;text-align:right}\nth:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}\n#rows table{max-width:900px}\n.num{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n```\n\n### app.js\n\n780 bytes, 20 lines\n\n```js\n(function () {\n  'use strict';\n  var d = window.RADAR;\n  if (!d) {\n    var el = document.getElementById('rows');\n    if (el) el.textContent = 'No data loaded: run main.ts first to write data.js.';\n    return;\n  }\n  var rows = document.getElementById('rows');\n  if (rows) {\n    var html = '<table><tr><th>#</th><th>Protocol</th><th>Category</th><th>TVL</th><th>Implied</th></tr>';\n    for (var i = 0; i < Math.min(20, d.rows.length); i++) {\n      var r = d.rows[i];\n      html += '<tr><td class=\"num\">' + r.rank + '</td><td>' + r.name + '</td><td>' + (r.category || '-') +\n        '</td><td class=\"num\">$' + r.tvl_usd.toLocaleString() + '</td><td class=\"num\">$' +\n        r.implied_value_usd.toLocaleString() + '</td></tr>';\n    }\n    rows.innerHTML = html + '</table>';\n  }\n})();\n```\n\n### index.html\n\n845 bytes, 19 lines\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Token Launch Radar - PLACEHOLDER (Phase 1)</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"app.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><h1>Token Launch Radar</h1><p class=\"ph\">Phase 1 placeholder dashboard - Phase 2 ships the full UI</p></header>\n<main>\n<section id=\"board\"><h2>Ranked board (placeholder)</h2><p>Loading board data...</p><div id=\"rows\"></div></section>\n<section id=\"live\"><h2>Live token set-aside (placeholder)</h2><p>Market values, not ranked. Loaded from data.js.</p></section>\n<section id=\"method\"><h2>Model (placeholder)</h2><p>implied = TVL x peerMultiple(category) x growthMult x maturityMult x chainMult</p></section>\n</main>\n<script src=\"data.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n"}